2026-07-28T04:40:50.5156348Z +     "\n",
2026-07-28T04:40:50.5156734Z +     "Skipping the duckdb test suite.\n",
2026-07-28T04:40:50.5157168Z +     "\n",
2026-07-28T04:40:50.5157797Z +     "The duckdb tests exercise DuckDB's bundled C++ engine and are deliberately\n",
