2026-07-28T04:40:50.5168896Z Skipping the duckdb test suite.
2026-07-28T04:40:50.5169157Z 
2026-07-28T04:40:50.5169595Z The duckdb tests exercise DuckDB's bundled C++ engine and are deliberately
